One table per group. Each line is one binding:

    mode | keys | description | command

  mode         "default", or the name of a sway mode (resize, adjust, game, break)
  keys         what follows `bindsym`, flags included: `$mod+space`, `--locked XF86AudioMute`
  description  shown in the key list (Mod+Shift+Space), waybar tooltips and docs/keys.md
  command      any sway command; `$bin` is the scripts directory

`bin/keys build` turns these tables into the sway config that is actually
loaded; reloading sway (Mod+Shift+C) rebuilds it first. Lines starting with #
and blank lines are ignored. File names set the order and the group title.
